The '''Narkina system''' was a [[star system]] in the [[Abrion sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> It contained the<ref name="Narkina 5">{{Andor|Narkina 5 (episode)}}</ref> [[gas giant]]<ref name="Narkina 5 Audio">{{Andor|Narkina 5 (episode)}} {{AD|Disney+}}</ref> [[Narkina]],<ref name="DRVG" /> and the [[moon]]s [[Narkina 2]],<ref name="Insider223" /> and [[Narkina 5]]<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> which hosted the [[Galactic Empire]] [[prison]]s known as  [[Imperial factory facility|Imperial factory facilities]].<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> 

